# --- Room 1/24 ---
dig Magma Chambers - Entrance
@desc A cavernous tunnel narrows ahead, its walls slick with soot. The faint luminescence here is foreboding, and you hear skittering claws that seem to come from everywhere at once.
@tags/set room-zone:magma_chambers
@open south=south to Magma Chambers - Grotto 2
@open east=east to Magma Chambers - Ascent

# --- Room 2/24 ---
