@desc The cave opens into a cramped chamber where ethereal radiance reflects off obsidian formations on the walls. You hear strange whispers echoing from deeper within, and the air is sweltering and foreboding.
@tags/set room-zone:magma_chambers
@spawn gen_assassin_lvl35
@tel here
@spawn gen_caster_lvl40
